Description: algorithms and data structures as a header-only C++20 library
 ADS is a header-only C++20 library of the algorithms and the data
 structures of the Italian textbook by A. Montresor, Algoritmi e Strutture
 Dati, with further structures from The Art of Computer Programming and
 from algorithm engineering: sequences, dictionaries, priority queues,
 trees, graphs, sorting, strings, succinct and compressed structures,
 numerics and optimization, each with its contracts.
 .
 This package installs the headers, the CMake package ADS (target
 ADS::ADS) and the pkg-config file ads.pc.
